9151 is OK\n- 10.1016/j.chest.2022.01.014 is OK\n- 10.1073/pnas.2024287118 is OK\n- 10.3389/fams.2020.00036 is OK\n- 10.1111/myc.13292 is OK\n- 10.1111/tid.12060 is OK\n- 10.1086/651262 is OK\n- 10.1098/rsif.2021.0806 is OK\n- 10.1007/s00285-023-01940-6 is OK\n- 10.1038/s41540-022-00247-4 is OK\n- 10.1016/0167-5699(92)90135-T is OK\n- 10.1371/journal.pone.0009862 is OK\n- 10.1038/s41598-021-93305-6 is OK\n- 10.1016/j.jtbi.2004.06.031 is OK\n\n🟡 SKIP DOIs\n\n- None\n\n❌ MISSING DOIs\n\n- None\n\n❌ INVALID DOIs\n\n- None\n\n```\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4416210495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4416279991","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4416279991","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4416279991,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABBzsVtw","user":{"login":"majensen","id":82073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen","html_url":"https://github.com/majensen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:32:36Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:35:25Z","body":"I believe the following unchecked issues from @dcnickle 's [checklist](https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4111254362) have been addressed:\n* Installation instructions: instructions at the repo now include both language builds and docker setup\n* Community Guidelines: a CONTRIBUTING.md has been added\n* Software availability statement: The repository is highlighted on the first paper of the MS after rendering. If you would like to add one sentence in the paper \"PAI is available at [...]\" that would be fine.\n* Quality of writing: very good\n* References: DOIs are fixed.\n\nFor the issues in Example Usage, Functionality Documentation, and Quality of Writing: These could be tsatified with a section in the repo README, \"Input/Output\", with a brief statement that describes the input parameters (initial numbers of lung cells, macrophages, conidia, and the number of iterations), and a description of the output record columns.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4416279991/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4416284866","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4416284866","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4416284866,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABBzsowg","user":{"login":"majensen","id":82073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen","html_url":"https://github.com/majensen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-10T20:34:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-10T20:34:56Z","body":"@deassisinfo, can you create a Zenodo archive of the repository for the submission? You can follow [this example](https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/1839#issuecomment-560048729). Please make the name of the archive the same as the paper name, and the archive authors the same as the paper authors. Just report back here the DOI of the archive. Thanks! ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4416284866/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4455307591","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4455307591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4455307591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABCY6ZRw","user":{"login":"deassisinfo","id":32418684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDE4Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32418684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo","html_url":"https://github.com/deassisinfo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-14T22:41:45Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T22:41:45Z","body":"Hey @majensen, we created the Zenodo archive. We made a few changes that were missing: 1) added an observation in the README saying that documentation is provided only for the Java Version, but that the C++ code is very similar to the Java code. 2) added a second observation in the README saying that the Java version contains code not present in the C++ version, but that this code is currently not being used. 3) added a section in the main text briefly describing the outputs and a table in the README with a more thorough description of the outputs. We also added a link to GitHub in the main text. \n\nMoreover, had already included working examples in the README. And running the code without parameters also gives you a working example ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4455307591/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4511844305","html_url":"https://github.com/openjo