https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deassisinfo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-29T13:49:48Z","updated_at":"2026-05-29T13:49:48Z","body":"@majensen, this https://github.com/openjournals/joss-papers/pull/8157 is closed. And yes, everything is fine now. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4575945156/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4592642744","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4592642744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4592642744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABEb4quA","user":{"login":"Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","id":8392709,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzOTI3MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8392709?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","html_url":"https://github.com/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T12:37:48Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T18:39:09Z","body":"@deassisinfo As AEiC for JOSS I will now help to process this submission for acceptance in JOSS. Below are some final checks:\n\n## Checks on repository\n- [x] Project has OSI approved license\n- [x] Project features contributing guidelines\n\n## Checks on review issue\n- [x] Review completed\n👉 Review appears incomplete as only the editor appears to have acted as a reviewer here. Over at the pre-review the GitHub user DavidNickle appears to have done this partial review https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/8411#issuecomment-4111183277. \n@majensen can you comment on this please? I see you have attempted to copy their review work (https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4111254362), however, in the original post over at the pre-review issue not all boxes were ticked. \n- [x] Software version tag listed here matches a tagged release\n👉 No I cannot see any releases tagged here: https://github.com/NutritionalLungImmunity/PAI/tags. A tagged release needs to be created and that version tag should be assigned here and over used over at the archived version. \n\n## Checks on archive\n- [x] Archive listed title and authors matches paper\n- [x] Archive listed license matches software license\n👉 No the archive link should list the project's MIT license (it currently says `Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International `). \n- [x] Archive listed version tag matches tagged release (and includes a potential `v`).\n\n## Checks on paper\n- [x] Checked paper formatting - including no text styling in title\n- [x] Check affiliations to make sure country acronyms are not used\n👉 Please spell out `USA` as `United States of America`.  \n- [x] Checked reference rendering\n- [x] Checked if pre-print citations can be updated by published versions\n- [x] Copyedit pass/checked for typos\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4592642744/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4593130978","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4593130978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4593130978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABEcWd4g","user":{"login":"majensen","id":82073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen","html_url":"https://github.com/majensen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/majensen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T13:41:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T13:41:17Z","body":"Thx @Kevin-Mattheus-Moerman I will ping @dcnickle","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4593130978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app