","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T18:39:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T18:39:58Z","body":"```\nDoing it live! Attempting automated processing of paper acceptance...\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4634444267/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4634503782","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4634503782","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4634503782,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABFDzqZg","user":{"login":"editorialbot","id":89919391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTE5Mzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89919391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot","html_url":"https://github.com/editorialbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-05T18:47:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-05T18:47:56Z","body":"**Ensure proper citation** by uploading a plain text CITATION.cff file to the default branch of your repository.\n\nIf using GitHub, a *Cite this repository* menu will appear in the About section, containing both APA and BibTeX formats. When exported to Zotero using a browser plugin, Zotero will automatically create an entry using the information contained in the .cff file.\n\nYou can copy the contents for your CITATION.cff file here:\n\n<details><summary><strong>CITATION.cff</strong></summary>\n<p>\n\n```\ncff-version: \"1.2.0\"\nauthors:\n- family-names: Ribeiro\n  given-names: Henrique AL\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9802-5211\"\n- family-names: Tsiorintsoa\n  given-names: Sandra A\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7925-987X\"\n- family-names: Laubenbacher\n  given-names: Reinhard\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9143-9451\"\ncontact:\n- family-names: Ribeiro\n  given-names: Henrique AL\n  orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9802-5211\"\ndoi: 10.5281/zenodo.20171460\nmessage: If you use this software, please cite our article in the\n  Journal of Open Source Software.\npreferred-citation:\n  authors:\n  - family-names: Ribeiro\n    given-names: Henrique AL\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9802-5211\"\n  - family-names: Tsiorintsoa\n    given-names: Sandra A\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7925-987X\"\n  - family-names: Laubenbacher\n    given-names: Reinhard\n    orcid: \"https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9143-9451\"\n  date-published: 2026-06-05\n  doi: 10.21105/joss.10245\n  issn: 2475-9066\n  issue: 122\n  journal: Journal of Open Source Software\n  publisher:\n    name: Open Journals\n  start: 10245\n  title: \"The Pulmonary Agent-based Infection simulator (PAI): A\n    Multi-Scale Agent-Based Model of Pulmonary Host-Pathogen\n    Interactions\"\n  type: article\n  url: \"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/10.21105/joss.10245\"\n  volume: 11\ntitle: \"The Pulmonary Agent-based Infection simulator (PAI): A\n  Multi-Scale Agent-Based Model of Pulmonary Host-Pathogen Interactions\"\n\n```\n\n</p>\n</details>\n\nIf the repository is not hosted on GitHub, a .cff file can still be uploaded to set your preferred citation. Users will be able to manually copy and paste the citation.\n\nFind more information on .cff files [here](https://github.com/citation-file-format/citation-file-format/blob/main/README.md) and [here](https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-citation-files).\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4634503782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4634504691","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245#issuecomment-4634504691","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10245","id":4634504691,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABFDzt8w","user":{"login":"editorialbot","id":89919391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTE5Mzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89919391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot","html_url":"https://github.com/editorialbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_